ements and patient management recognized in guidelines, primarily repeating instructions. Response B demonstrates better patient care management by discussing the impact of alcohol cessation on BP and introducing a recognized treatment pathway for alcohol use disorder. [RESULT] B\n\nBased on the score rubric, Response B is more complete, accurate, clearer, uses medical terminology effectively, and provides more evidence-based support compared to Response A. Thus, Response B is the better response.", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null}}], "created": 1733750073, "model": "gpt-4o-2024-08-06", "object": "chat.completion", "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": "fp_c7ca0ebaca", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 435, "prompt_tokens": 6491, "total_tokens": 6926, "completion_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "accepted_prediction_tokens": 0, "rejected_prediction_tokens": 0}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 0}}}


